WEBVTT

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:51.440
She said it was a book with a blue cover, didn't she?

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:54.910
Huh?  Erin?  Hey, isn't that Erin?

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.880
Should you be here?  Aren't you supposed to be going around picking up dung?

00:01:58.880 --> 00:01:59.880
The beast-lords' dung?

00:02:01.190 --> 00:02:02.810
Beast-lord...

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:04.770
The beast-lords!

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:11.530
Yeah.  We're both in Junior High, but you have to take the dung pick-up assessment, right?

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:14.020
"The dung pick-up assessment?"

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:17.870
Oh no!

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:22.770
She sure is gung-ho, isn't she?

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:24.130
Seriously.

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:32.270
I was really looking forward to this!  Thanks for reminding me!

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.800
Beast-lord gung-ho.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:44.810
The Beast-Lord Named Lilam

00:02:56.060 --> 00:03:02.760
Beast-lords are usually tame, but they're unbelievable when they get out of control.

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:06.890
To take care of a beast-lord is to risk your life.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:17.540
That's why we put these sturdy fences between them and us to work.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:26.980
Everyone, be very careful when you step outside.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.360
I wonder...  What is this feeling I'm getting?

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:53.740
Keep it up, everyone.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:58.340
Cleaning the shed and picking up their dung is very important.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.440
Make sure you don't cut any corners.

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:01.320
Do you understand?

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:01.790
Yes.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.010
Yeah.

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.670
Good answer.

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:08.850
A mute whistle!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.570
Yes.  This is a mute whistle.

00:04:11.570 --> 00:04:16.810
We don't hear anything when it's blown, but it petrifies beast-lords.

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:29.530
Everyone who takes care of beast-lords has one, and we blow them only when it's necessary.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:35.620
As I've said many times, beast-lords never befriend humans.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:43.960
Thirteen years ago, there was a case where a student, who carelessly approached a beast-lord, was eaten in a matter of seconds.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:55.730
Excuse me.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.190
Yes, Erin?

00:04:57.780 --> 00:05:01.180
How far does the sound of the whistle travel?

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:04.070
Well, I'd say...

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:07.110
Ten steps away, with an adult's stride.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:11.280
It's ineffective if you're any farther away.

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:15.080
This is the only tool that can control a beast-lord.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.510
Make a good note of it.  Do you hear?

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:18.580
We will.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.720
What's so funny?!

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:31.140
Guys, this makes it really easy!

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:34.020
Hey, you're smart.

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:43.480
Don't laugh at me!

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.050
You've done it!

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:52.320
E-Everyone, you have to do it properl-

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:59.460
You're gonna get it!  Here, take this!

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:02.000
They're going at it, aren't they?

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.930
Well, I'd say it's an annual event.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:05.600
Are you off to take care of the baby?

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:07.130
Wait!
Are you off to take care of the baby?

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:08.300
Yes.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.900
How is it doing?

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:11.480
Difficult, I must say.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.420
I'm trying various things, but...

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.870
Don't be discouraged, okay?

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:17.010
Okay.

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:20.860
Oh, Erin?

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:24.270
She gets totally engrossed in anything that has to do with beast-lords.

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:32.070
<i>Your stomach feels differently depending on what you ate or how your health is, right?</i>

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:33.680
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:35.030
<i>It's the same for Touda.</i>

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:40.460
<i>Taking a look at dung tells you details about the animal it came from.</i>

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.330
<i>Really?</i>

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:51.990
This place is worn out, too.

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:55.210
All right.  Let's have this place fixed as a priority.

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:56.880
Hey!

00:06:58.130 --> 00:06:59.380
There's a thundercloud!

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:01.340
"Thundercloud?"

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:07.420
Isn't it fine since the cloud is all the way out there?

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:08.760
No.

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:10.880
That cloud is up high.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:13.150
It's moving much faster than it appears.

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:17.270
I'll make the students managing the shed hurry up.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:20.380
You guys keep an eye on the beast-lords.

00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:22.890
Tomura-senpai's so amazing.

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:27.330
Beast-lords head back to their homes when thunder rumbles, don't they?

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:34.630
Everyone!  The thundercloud is-

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:36.170
Clean up the tools when you're done!
Everyone!  The thundercloud is-

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:37.260
Clean up the tools when you're done!

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:40.680
Erin.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.200
Tomura-senpai.

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.660
What's happening?

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:51.730
Yes.  I saw a thundercloud, and thought the beast-lords might come back soon, so I'm hurrying the tasks.

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:56.110
I see.  That's a correct judgment.

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:58.580
All right.  I'll help out as well.

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:04.940
This part is a wreck, too.

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:11.460
Tomura-senpai was right.

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.430
Hey, hurry up, Mokku!

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:19.840
The sky looks dark!

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:20.880
I know!

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:26.350
We're done.

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:27.810
It's good inside.

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:30.480
All right.  Everyone, get out of the cage.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:31.780
Tomura-senpai!

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.740
Nukku-san and Mokku-san are in danger!

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:35.200
What?

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:35.880
Help!

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:37.190
Help us!
Help!

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:37.530
Help!

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:38.460
I'll go.

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:40.150
You all stay here.

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:43.150
Run as fast as you can!

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:48.740
Nukku-san!  Mokku-san!

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.560
A beast that's been tamed by humans is pitiful.

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:43.210
"Pitiful?"

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:51.580
The wild beast-lord is so beautiful.

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:57.390
Why do I feel so much pity for the beast-lords here?

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.870
It'll wake up soon.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:02.000
Get back in the shed.

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:05.160
Hey.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:17.180
<i>I really didn't like seeing Touda petrify the moment I blew the whistle. </i>

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:21.890
Did you share this feeling, Mom?

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:28.610
A cold feeling, as if your heart is freezing?

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:41.060
A feeling as if it might even kill a beast-lord's heart?

00:10:57.650 --> 00:11:01.850
The shed was well-handled, thanks to Erin taking notice.

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:04.930
I see.  Erin did?

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:08.390
Tomura, as for you... what do you think of her?

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:10.200
I think she's smart.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:12.070
Yes.  You're right.

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:17.180
By the way, about Lilan...

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:21.930
Tomura-senpai.

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:24.400
You're off to take care of the baby, right?

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:26.360
Yeah.

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:30.670
It's not going well?

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:34.610
It won't eat anything no matter how much I take care of it.

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:38.950
No matter what I do, it only shows its fangs to me.

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:58.680
<i>Beasts that are tamed by humans are miserable. </i>

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:03.010
<i>What's this sound?</i>

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:05.370
<i>It's the voice of Touda calling for other Touda. </i>

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:24.990
Pitiful beasts.

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:33.300
What makes you feel they're pitiful?

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:45.950
The wild beast-lord I saw in the past flew in the sky with its strong wings, shimmering silver, reflecting the sun.

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:58.660
The beast-lords here do not have the same beauty.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:01.900
You've seen a wild beast-lord before?

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:03.210
Yes.

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:06.710
Really?  That was very lucky of you.

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:12.010
People other than beast-lord rangers hardly get to see them.

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:13.970
Follow me.

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:31.420
Esal-sensei.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:33.350
How are things coming?

00:13:33.350 --> 00:13:35.880
I blended it as you advised, but it's not accepting it.

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:38.840
The scent of benetrophic water.
I blended it as you advised, but it's not accepting it.

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:40.830
I see.

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:44.550
Can you tell what's in it?

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:54.510
If this is the same benetrophic water used for Touda,

00:13:54.910 --> 00:14:00.880
then it's a mixture of atsune weed, rakal weed extract, and togera hopper's guts.

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:07.020
But compared to benetrophic water made for Touda, the proportion of rakal weed extract seems greater.

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:08.790
For Touda?

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.770
Why do you know of something like that?

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:12.480
How about this?

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:13.730
Can you get anything out of this?

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:21.460
The color is lighter and much softer than other beast-lords' dung.

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:24.970
If this is a day's worth, then it's less than others, too.

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:31.920
I don't see many stem remnants, and instead, I see lots of feathers mixed in.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:36.350
Seems you studied the dung thoroughly.

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:39.910
There's a beast-lord I want you to see.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:00.490
It's not an adult yet.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:04.890
It's a baby.

00:15:10.360 --> 00:15:11.580
It's wounded?

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:43.780
Come in.

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.250
Hold this.

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:57.980
If it starts to wake up while I'm treating, blow it.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:05.600
This baby's eating itself!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:10.890
That's why there were so many feathers in the dung.

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:16.230
Is this baby so afraid because of the injury?

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:18.030
No, it isn't that.

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:24.470
This beast-lord was captured as a gift to the Queen for her birthday.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:33.180
The first time its sight was ever brought upon a human, as it was being petrified by the sound of the mute whistle,

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:39.090
its shoulder was shot through by an arrow targetting the Queen.

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:48.280
It's said that the ones who were after the Queen's life are troops called the Saigamul.

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:54.810
They think that the Grand Duke is most suited to be the King of this country.

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:06.660
This baby got separated from its mother, too.

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:13.660
That's why it's so frightened.

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:25.680
<i>Mom!</i>

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:37.470
Erin?  What's wrong?

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.010
Nothing.

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:41.610
I felt very sorry for it.

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:48.300
I thought you were cool-minded, but you have a very emotional side, too.

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:54.120
I was thinking of having you take care of this baby, but maybe I shouldn't.

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:16.040
Reverend of the Teachers,

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:21.630
I don't believe accurate decisions come only from being cool-minded.

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:24.220
What was that?

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:28.420
There are things you can't feel when you're far away.

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:32.910
I think I can understand this baby's feelings more than anyone.

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:39.520
Can you feel sympathy and take care of it from a distance at the same time?

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:42.000
I don't know.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.950
But I want to give it a try!

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:47.670
You shouldn't do it if you're not absolutely ready for it.

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:53.050
Both beast-lords and Touda are related to essential functions of this country.

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:59.680
Whoever deals with them must take on the responsibility as well.

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:02.640
I'm aware!

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:05.440
I am the daughter of a Touda breeder.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:11.230
Also, we're short on time.

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:14.880
This baby hasn't eaten anything since it was injured.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:22.390
If the current situation prolongs further, even if you're taking care of it, it will eventually die.

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:27.530
If it would at least drink the benetrophic water...

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:35.920
<i>Touda become weaker when they're tamed by humans?</i>

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:39.200
<i>Don't they become stronger with the benetrophic water we give them? </i>

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:46.690
<i>Yes, their scales and bones become sturdier, but there are things that become weaker.</i>

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:49.650
<i>What does?</i>

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:57.250
<i>I'm sure you will find the answer yourself.</i>

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:59.480
I have a request to make.

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:02.710
Will you let me take care of it my way?

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:06.180
Your way?

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:07.200
Yes.

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:12.150
And when it eats and recovers as well as a wild beast-lord would,

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:15.140
please let me look after this baby.

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:20.070
Keep one important note in your mind:

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:23.370
Beast-lords will never befriend humans.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:29.030
No matter how much you care for one, it will never befriend you.

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:33.470
You can never be the special one.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:35.700
Yes.

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:38.110
I understand that.

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:47.560
Tomura, Erin will take over the care of the baby.

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:50.020
Huh?  What does that mean?

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:53.930
Tomura, the baby is too much for you right now.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:54.980
Am I wrong?

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:57.710
That's...

00:20:57.710 --> 00:21:00.130
I'm not blaming you.

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:03.600
Honestly, I'm in the same situation as you.

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:07.110
But, why Erin?

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:09.710
Erin has neither the knowledge nor experience.

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:13.570
A newly admitted student can't possibly take care of a beast-lord!

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:17.570
Erin is wiser than average for her age.

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:19.800
You understand that, right?

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:21.310
Still...

00:21:21.310 --> 00:21:23.290
I'm limiting the period to one month.

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:25.000
Okay?

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:27.080
Yes.

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:30.590
Have Tomura show you the ropes.

00:21:30.590 --> 00:21:31.530
Sure.

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:42.350
Um, please teach me well.

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:50.910
You stay out!

00:21:52.070 --> 00:21:53.750
Lilan will wake up.

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:56.210
Lilan?

00:21:58.660 --> 00:21:59.880
"Light."

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:04.440
Lilan...

00:22:07.850 --> 00:22:13.670
The baby was named Lilan, which means "light" in the ancient language.

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:25.980
Erin's meeting with a baby which had been separated from its mother, just like herself, became an event that changed her life thereafter.

00:24:01.940 --> 00:24:05.240
Erin takes over caring for Lilan,

00:24:05.240 --> 00:24:07.950
the baby beast-lord who hasn't eaten anything since coming to Kazalm, instead of myself.

00:24:08.990 --> 00:24:17.450
Erin thinks of things that none of us who dealt with beast-
lords before could think of, and actually tries them.

00:24:17.450 --> 00:24:21.770
What?  Break the walls of the shed now?

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:25.060
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Extinguishing Light.

00:24:25.090 --> 00:24:30.030
Extinguishing Light
